---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lang = 'it-it';
const title = 'Cookie Policy | Amalfi Coast Travel Guide';
const description = "Informativa sull'uso dei cookie su amalficoast-travel.com.";
const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/it-it/' },
  { name: 'Cookie Policy', url: '/it-it/cookie-policy/' },
];
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} {lang} {breadcrumbs}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-12">Ultimo aggiornamento: maggio 2026</p>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">1. Cosa sono i cookie</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">I cookie sono piccoli file di testo salvati sul tuo dispositivo quando visiti un sito web. Permettono al sito di raccogliere dati statistici anonimi sul comportamento di navigazione.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">2. Cookie utilizzati</h2>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3 mt-6">Cookie tecnici (sempre attivi)</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-3 text-sm">Necessari al funzionamento del sito. Non richiedono consenso.</p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-b-xl border border-slate-200">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead><tr class="bg-slate-900 text-white"><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Cookie</th><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Durata</th><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Descrizione</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">cc_cookie</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">6 mesi</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">Memorizza le preferenze di consenso ai cookie</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3 mt-8">Cookie analitici (richiedono consenso)</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-3 text-sm">Attivati solo dopo consenso esplicito.</p>

      <p class="font-medium text-slate-700 mb-2 mt-4 text-sm">Google Analytics 4</p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-b-xl border border-slate-200 mb-6">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead><tr class="bg-slate-900 text-white"><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Cookie</th><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Durata</th><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Descrizione</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">_ga</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">2 anni</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">Distingue gli utenti del sito</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">_ga_*</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">2 anni</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">Mantiene lo stato della sessione di Analytics</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">_gid</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">24 ore</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">Distingue gli utenti (sessione giornaliera)</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="font-medium text-slate-700 mb-2 text-sm">Microsoft Clarity</p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-b-xl border border-slate-200">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead><tr class="bg-slate-900 text-white"><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Cookie</th><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Durata</th><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Descrizione</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">_clck</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">1 anno</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">Identificatore utente persistente</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">_clsk</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">24 ore</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">Consolida le visualizzazioni di pagina in una sessione</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">3. Come gestire i cookie</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Puoi modificare le preferenze in qualsiasi momento cliccando su <strong>Gestisci preferenze</strong> nel banner cookie. Puoi anche disabilitarli dal browser:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-600 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Chrome</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/it/kb/gestione-dei-cookie" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mozilla Firefox</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/it-it/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Safari</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/it-it/microsoft-edge/eliminare-i-cookie-in-microsoft-edge-63947406-40ac-c3b8-57b9-2a946a29ae09" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Microsoft Edge</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">4. Titolare</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Amalfi Coast Travel · <a href="mailto:amalficoastravel@gmail.com" class="text-med-blue hover:underline">amalficoastravel@gmail.com</a><br/>
      Per ulteriori informazioni: <a href="/it-it/privacy-policy/" class="text-med-blue hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
